{"parentUuid":"eb115a20-faa1-4ed4-9f84-d093b2498612","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgvRQwVfvbyTB7t623AhW","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_011UvJfa2eyJbenWCpLMPsCq","name":"AskUserQuestion","input":{"questions":[{"question":"The release key isn't made yet, so a tagged release would fail at its signing step. How do you want to go?","header":"Release key","multiSelect":false,"options":[{"label":"I'll make the key first (Recommended)","description":"You run: brew install minisign; minisign -G -W -p scripts/minisign.pub -s ~/.minisign/bastion.key; gh secret set MINISIGN_SECRET_KEY --repo tacoda/bastion < ~/.minisign/bastion.key (as the account that owns tacoda/bastion). Then say continue, and I commit the public key and release v0.1.0 signed."},{"label":"Release unsigned now","description":"The workflow signs only when the secret exists; v0.1.0 ships with SHA256SUMS but no signature, and the installer and bastion update accept a missing signature until the key exists. Weaker until you add the key."},{"label":"Make the key for me","description":"I generate the pair with minisign in a file only you can read, set the secret from that file without printing it, and commit the public half. The secret key then sits on this machine at ~/.minisign/bastion.key."}]}]},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":493,"cache_read_input_tokens":806503,"output_tokens":832,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":394},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":493,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":832,"cache_read_input_tokens":806503,"cache_creation_input_tokens":493,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"e