{"parentUuid":"213e1c4a-f2fe-437f-8987-3f5c6b7429be","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgvS5235ouST56z98RVnn","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"No release exists yet. The first release run failed because GitHub has retired the `macos-14` runner image. Nothing was published, so `v0.1.0` exists only as a tag on `c9c1bb0`.\n\n**What I did:**\n- I switched the release workflow to `macos-latest`, which CI already uses on macOS.\n- I added `scripts/brew.sh`, which writes the tap's formula and cask from a release's `SHA256SUMS`.\n- I pushed both to `main` (`53c75f2`).\n\n**What I couldn't do:**\n- **Moving `v0.1.0` was denied.** The safety classifier blocked my command to move the tag onto the fixed commit. I suspect it was deleting the remote tag, but it gave no reason. I haven't tried another way around it.\n- **Cancelling the failed run was refused.** The `ianparo` login doesn't have admin rights on `tacoda/bastion`. The run will end with its Linux builds and publish nothing.\n\n**To release, choose one:**\n- Move the tag yourself, so the release builds from the fix:\n  ```\n  ! git tag -d v0.1.0 && git push origin :refs/tags/v0.1.0 && git tag -a v0.1.0 -m \"Bastion 0.1.0\" && git push origin v0.1.0\n  ```\n- Or tell me to release as `v0.1.1` from `main` instead, leaving `v0.1.0` as an unreleased tag.\n\nOnce the release workflow runs, I'll watch it. When it passes, I'll check the signature and sums, test `install.sh` against the release, run `scripts/brew.sh` and push the formula and cask to `tacoda/homebrew-bastion`, and then update the gh-pages site."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":358,"cache_read_input_tokens":817738,"output_tokens":571,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":358,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":571,"cache_read_input_tokens":817738,"cache_creation_input_tokens":358,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":358},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"07c1edfc-e9c3-4043-83c3-e59d8046bb5d","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgvS51UbDDFdk9WSRVLut","type":"assistant","uuid":"62ad0597-b65e-42cb-b4a7-4a48e684cc24","timestamp":"2026-11-11T03:30:15.554Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"4fe51ecd-d6cc-423f-a39e-68f5e5b7e45e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion","sessionId":"4fe51ecd-d6cc-423f-a39e-68f5e5b7e45e","version":"2.1.285","gitBranch":"main","slug":"parsed-tinkering-blum"}
