{"parentUuid":"373ba252-53b5-44e8-94e9-749b0aa87846","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"edited_text_file","filename":"/Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion/scripts/brew.sh","snippet":"1\t#!/usr/bin/env bash\n2\t# Write the Homebrew tap's formula and cask for a release (PLAN.md F10):\n3\t#   Formula/bastion.rb  the server and the CLI, with their stack\n4\t#   Casks/bastion.rb    Bastion.app, which holds them too\n5\t# Usage: scripts/brew.sh <version> <SHA256SUMS> <tap checkout>\n6\tset -euo pipefail\n7\t\n8\tversion=\"${1:?usage: scripts/brew.sh <version> <SHA256SUMS> <tap>}\"\n9\tsums=\"${2:?the SHA256SUMS of the release}\"\n10\ttap=\"${3:?a checkout of the tap}\"\n11\tv=\"${version#v}\"\n12\turl=\"https://github.com/tacoda/bastion/releases/download/v$v\"\n13\t\n14\tsum() {\n15\t  local found\n16\t  found=\"$(grep \" $1\\$\" \"$sums\" | cut -d ' ' -f 1)\"\n17\t  [ -n \"$found\" ] || { echo \"$1 is not in $sums\" >&2; exit 1; }\n18\t  echo \"$found\""},"type":"attachment","uuid":"049d88b6-088d-46b9-b481-14349f2a11ce","timestamp":"2026-11-11T03:41:05.038Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\nNote: /Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion/scripts/brew.sh changed on disk since you last read it. That's usually deliberate, so take it as the current state rather than reverting it; if the change looks wrong, say so rather than undoing it yourself — otherwise no need to call it out. Here are the relevant changes (shown with line numbers):\n1\t#!/usr/bin/env bash\n2\t# Write the Homebrew tap's formula and cask for a release (PLAN.md F10):\n3\t#   Formula/bastion.rb  the server and the CLI, with their stack\n4\t#   Casks/bastion.rb    Bastion.app, which holds them too\n5\t# Usage: scripts/brew.sh <version> <SHA256SUMS> <tap checkout>\n6\tset -euo pipefail\n7\t\n8\tversion=\"${1:?usage: scripts/brew.sh <version> <SHA256SUMS> <tap>}\"\n9\tsums=\"${2:?the SHA256SUMS of the release}\"\n10\ttap=\"${3:?a checkout of the tap}\"\n11\tv=\"${version#v}\"\n12\turl=\"https://github.com/tacoda/bastion/releases/download/v$v\"\n13\t\n14\tsum() {\n15\t  local found\n16\t  found=\"$(grep \" $1\\$\" \"$sums\" | cut -d ' ' -f 1)\"\n17\t  [ -n \"$found\" ] || { echo \"$1 is not in $sums\" >&2; exit 1; }\n18\t  echo \"$found\"\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","session_id":"4fe51ecd-d6cc-423f-a39e-68f5e5b7e45e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion","sessionId":"4fe51ecd-d6cc-423f-a39e-68f5e5b7e45e","version":"2.1.285","gitBranch":"main","slug":"parsed-tinkering-blum"}
