rding artifacts with tests, and we run it live when the disk and the stack are free."}],"multiSelect":false}],"answers":{"F11 needs a VM image with a browser. Which image should the browser jobs boot?":"Microsoft's Playwright image (Recommended)","Trying the image means restarting the stack your installed app runs, from a dev build with the new compose file. When can I do that?":"Now, after I free disk space"},"annotations":{}},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"c298d607-f2e9-4296-bc55-477b29735040","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion","root":"/Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion","branch":"main","default_branch":"main","status":{"clean":true,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":0,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":0},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":null,"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[],"visibility_cache":[]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion","platform":"macos"}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"94992879-661f-4513-8bdf-3dbbc522fec6","session_id":"4fe51ecd-d6cc-423f-a39e-68f5e5b7e45e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion","sessionId":"4fe51ecd-d6cc-423f-a39e-68f5e5b7e45e","version":"2.1.285","gitBranch":"main","slug":"parsed-tinkering-blum"}
