{"parentUuid":"59004364-2f0e-4b9f-a7cd-ba0ca3abedcd","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"edited_text_file","filename":"/Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion/crates/bastion-core/src/media.rs","snippet":"25\t\n26\t/// The kept file an artifact records, if it records one.\n27\tpub fn named(body: &str) -> Option<&str> {\n28\t    body.strip_prefix(KEPT).filter(|n| kept(n))\n29\t}\n30\t\n31\t/// The content type a kept file is served with.\n32\tpub fn content_type(name: &str) -> &'static str {\n33\t    match name\n34\t        .rsplit_once('.')\n35\t        .map(|(_, e)| e.to_ascii_lowercase())\n36\t        .as_deref()\n37\t    {\n38\t        Some(\"png\") => \"image/png\",\n39\t        Some(\"jpg\" | \"jpeg\") => \"image/jpeg\",\n40\t        Some(\"gif\") => \"image/gif\",\n41\t        Some(\"webp\") => \"image/webp\",\n42\t        Some(\"webm\") => \"video/webm\",\n43\t        Some(\"mp4\") => \"video/mp4\",\n44\t        _ => \"application/octet-stream\",\n45\t    }"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"85637c87-d1c5-415e-aad4-49ec7b92086f","timestamp":"2026-11-11T04:11:14.429Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\nNote: /Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion/crates/bastion-core/src/media.rs changed on disk since you last read it. That's usually deliberate, so take it as the current state rather than reverting it; if the change looks wrong, say so rather than undoing it yourself — otherwise no need to call it out. Here are the relevant changes (shown with line numbers):\n25\t\n26\t/// The kept file an artifact records, if it records one.\n27\tpub fn named(body: &str) -> Option<&str> {\n28\t    body.strip_prefix(KEPT).filter(|n| kept(n))\n29\t}\n30\t\n31\t/// The content type a kept file is served with.\n32\tpub fn content_type(name: &str) -> &'static str {\n33\t    match name\n34\t        .rsplit_once('.')\n35\t        .map(|(_, e)| e.to_ascii_lowercase())\n36\t        .as_deref()\n37\t    {\n38\t        Some(\"png\") => \"image/png\",\n39\t        Some(\"jpg\" | \"jpeg\") => \"image/jpeg\",\n40\t        Some(\"gif\") => \"image/gif\",\n41\t        Some(\"webp\") => \"image/webp\",\n42\t        Some(\"webm\") => \"video/webm\",\n43\t        Some(\"mp4\") => \"video/mp4\",\n44\t        _ => \"application/octet-stream\",\n45\t    }\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","session_id":"4fe51ecd-d6cc-423f-a39e-68f5e5b7e45e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion","sessionId":"4fe51ecd-d6cc-423f-a39e-68f5e5b7e45e","version":"2.1.285","gitBranch":"main","slug":"parsed-tinkering-blum"}
