 image\n2a3eaa5 A server an app opened from Finder starts still finds iii\n949d25a A client finds the token of a local server another build started\n9cad9e6 The cask clears Bastion.app's quarantine itself, as Homebrew 7 dropped --no-quarantine\n\nClaude Code attached this context automatically; it isn't part of the user's message. It describes the user's own account and workspace, so they don't need it reported back.\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"user","session_id":"4fe51ecd-d6cc-423f-a39e-68f5e5b7e45e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion","sessionId":"4fe51ecd-d6cc-423f-a39e-68f5e5b7e45e","version":"2.1.285","gitBranch":"main","slug":"parsed-tinkering-blum"}
