{"parentUuid":"7e51125f-b1fb-4a3f-93c4-0bfef8450f06","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"305cbff3-a896-4b01-84bb-b6b3038a90f7","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01NdsxLSy58XzVhL6WSw7h4h","type":"tool_result","content":"61:const BROWSER_GUIDE: &str = \"\\\n62-This VM has Node and Playwright's Chromium, Firefox and WebKit under\n63-/ms-playwright, but not the playwright npm package; a workspace whose setup\n64-installs playwright@1.65.0 can drive them from a script and record video.\n65-Without it, take a screenshot with\n66-/ms-playwright/chromium_headless_shell-*/chrome-headless-shell-linux*/chrome-headless-shell\n67---no-sandbox --window-size=1280,800 --screenshot=/work/artifacts/home.png URL.\n68-The VM has no network, so serve the app on 127.0.0.1, and start the server in\n69-the same command as the browser: a background process ends with its command.\n70-Keep each screenshot (.png) and recording (.webm) under /work/artifacts; they\n71-are kept with the job for the person to see.\\n\\n\";\n72-\n73-/// The VM tag a read-only turn's tree is put back to.","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"d92de975-e8f6-4552-929d-a28627ea9763","timestamp":"2026-11-11T04:28:21.551Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"61:const BROWSER_GUIDE: &str = \"\\\n62-This VM has Node and Playwright's Chromium, Firefox and WebKit under\n63-/ms-playwright, but not the playwright npm package; a workspace whose setup\n64-installs playwright@1.65.0 can drive them from a script and record video.\n65-Without it, take a screenshot with\n66-/ms-playwright/chromium_headless_shell-*/chrome-headless-shell-linux*/chrome-headless-shell\n67---no-sandbox --window-size=1280,800 --screenshot=/work/artifacts/home.png URL.\n68-The VM has no network, so serve the app on 127.0.0.1, and start the server in\n69-the same command as the browser: a background process ends with its command.\n70-Keep each screenshot (.png) and recording (.webm) under /work/artifacts; they\n71-are kept with the job for the person to see.\\n\\n\";\n72-\n73-/// The VM tag a read-only turn's tree is put back to.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false,"bashEditDiff":{"files":[{"filePath":"/Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion/crates/bastion-server/src/factory.rs","hunks":[{"oldStart":59,"oldLines":10,"newStart":59,"newLines":16,"lines":[" }"," /// What a turn on the browser image is told it has (F11)."," const BROWSER_GUIDE: &str = \"\\","-This VM has Playwright with Chromium, Firefox and WebKit, and Node. It has no","-network, so serve the app inside the VM (for example on 127.0.0.1) and point the","-browser there. Keep each screenshot (.png) and recording (.webm) you make under","-/work/artifacts; they are kept with the job for the person to see.\\n\\n\";","+This VM has Node and Playwright's Chromium, Firefox and WebKit under","+/ms-playwright, but not the playwright npm package; a workspace whose setup","+installs playwright@1.65.0 can drive them from a script and record video.","+Without it, take a screenshot with","+/ms-playwright/chromium_headless_shell-*/chrome-headless-shell-linux*/chrome-headless-shell","+--no-sandbox --window-size=1280,800 --screenshot=/work/artifacts/home.png URL.","+The VM has no network, so serve the app on 127.0.0.1, and start the server in","+the same command as the browser: a background process ends with its command.","+Keep each screenshot (.png) and recording (.webm) under /work/artifacts; they","+are kept with the job for the person to see.\\n\\n\";"," "," /// The VM tag a read-only turn's tree is put back to."," const BEFORE_TURN: &str = \"bastion-before-turn\";"]}]},{"filePath":"/Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion/crates/bastion-server/src/factory/setup.rs","hunks":[{"oldStart":16,"oldLines":6,"newStart":16,"newLines":8,"lines":[" const EXEC_MS: u64 = 120_000;"," /// The repository as a tarball, in a VM."," pub(super) const TREE: &str = \"/work/repo.tgz\";","+/// Where the browser image keeps Playwright's browsers.","+const BROWSERS: &str = \"/ms-playwright\";"," /// Brings the loopback interface up: an offline VM boots with `lo` down, so"," /// nothing can serve on 127.0.0.1 for a test or a browser. The images have"," /// Perl but no `ip`, so this is the ioctl `ip link set lo up` makes."]},{"oldStart":52,"oldLines":7,"newStart":54,"newLines":11,"lines":["         network: bool,","         ws: &Workspace,","     ) -> Result<String, String> {","-        let env = ws.env_vars()?;","+        let mut env = ws.env_vars()?;","+        if image == \"browser\" {","+            // The image's own environment does not reach the VM.","+            env.push(format!(\"PLAYWRIGHT_BROWSERS_PATH={BROWSERS}\"));","+        }","         let vm =","             json!({ \"image\": image, \"network\": network, \"env\": env, \"idle_timeout_secs\": 3600 });","         let made = self"]}]}],"moreFiles":0,"changedFiles":["/Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion/crates/bastion-server/src/factory.rs","/Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion/crates/bastion-server/src/factory/setup.rs"]}},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"2264c06a-d2fb-4de5-9ea0-5b3826fac9b3","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion","root":"/Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion","branch":"main","default_branch":"main","status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":1,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":0},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":null,"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[],"visibility_cache":[]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion","platform":"macos"}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"7e51125f-b1fb-4a3f-93c4-0bfef8450f06","session_id":"4fe51ecd-d6cc-423f-a39e-68f5e5b7e45e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion","sessionId":"4fe51ecd-d6cc-423f-a39e-68f5e5b7e45e","version":"2.1.285","gitBranch":"main","slug":"parsed-tinkering-blum"}
