{"parentUuid":"78debcb1-937a-42c3-8a51-4501511f9143","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"305cbff3-a896-4b01-84bb-b6b3038a90f7","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01BQbUCofzBkTQk9sAJwnVfX","type":"tool_result","content":"---\nname: bastion-run-every-ci-step\ndescription: \"Before pushing Bastion, run every step in .github/workflows (seams, both clippies with -D warnings), not only fmt and tests\"\nmetadata:\n  node_type: memory\n  type: feedback\n  originSessionId: 4fe51ecd-d6cc-423f-a39e-68f5e5b7e45e\n  modified: 2026-11-06T22:46:31.156Z\n---\n\nBefore a push, run every `run:` step of the CI workflow, not a subset:\nfmt --check, `scripts/check-seams.sh`, clippy on the workspace (excluding\nbastion-ui) with `-D warnings`, clippy on bastion-ui for wasm32 with\n`-D warnings`, and both test runs.\n\n**Why:** CI failed twice for steps skipped locally: once on fmt, and on\n2026-11-06 on the seam check, which forbids bastion-core depending on\nserde_json (it may use serde and sha2 only).\n\n**How to apply:** `grep -n \"run:\" .github/workflows/*.yml` lists them; run all\nbefore each push.\n36:        run: cargo clippy --workspace --all-targets -- -D warnings","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"ce7d563c-585f-43d2-8828-8352d1a161a6","timestamp":"2026-11-11T04:31:47.250Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"---\nname: bastion-run-every-ci-step\ndescription: \"Before pushing Bastion, run every step in .github/workflows (seams, both clippies with -D warnings), not only fmt and tests\"\nmetadata:\n  node_type: memory\n  type: feedback\n  originSessionId: 4fe51ecd-d6cc-423f-a39e-68f5e5b7e45e\n  modified: 2026-11-06T22:46:31.156Z\n---\n\nBefore a push, run every `run:` step of the CI workflow, not a subset:\nfmt --check, `scripts/check-seams.sh`, clippy on the workspace (excluding\nbastion-ui) with `-D warnings`, clippy on bastion-ui for wasm32 with\n`-D warnings`, and both test runs.\n\n**Why:** CI failed twice for steps skipped locally: once on fmt, and on\n2026