{"parentUuid":"6897458e-7a3a-449e-84ed-95688b162753","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"8cf1e2cd-8fa2-4ec6-95a6-485fe6c5468a","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01NzQCb8swDhanKrX1Kv9coX","type":"tool_result","content":"## 7. Open questions\n\n- **Dark to merge.** ghola never lets a factory merge unattended; Bastion's\n  dark dial can run to merge. Should merge always need a person, or a machine\n  verdict (F4)?\n- **Configuration in git.** ghola keeps configuration in files under review;\n  Bastion keeps it in the database with versions (D26). Should rules also be\n  importable as files, such as team rule packs shared by servers?\n- **Multi-user hosting.** A shared server with people and TLS works today.\n  Is hosted Bastion a goal?\n- **Unused stack workers.** C4 lists them; some may be the harness's\n  dependencies.\n\n## 8. Progress","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"ed678909-16e6-4178-a2da-cf10c3b7dae7","timestamp":"2026-11-11T04:52:52.528Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"## 7. Open questions\n\n- **Dark to merge.** ghola never lets a factory merge unattended; Bastion's\n  dark dial can run to merge. Should merge always need a person, or a machine\n  verdict (F4)?\n- **Configuration in git.** ghola keeps configuration in files under review;\n  Bastion keeps it in the database with versions (D26). Should rules also be\n  importable as files, such as team rule packs shared by servers?\n- **Multi-user hosting.** A shared server with people and TLS works today.\n  Is hosted Bastion a goal?\n- **Unused stack workers.** C4 lists them; some may be the harness's\n  dependencies.\n\n## 8. Progress","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"49f7d9b9-b767-451b-b18d-56a875645d22","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion","root":"/Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion","branch":"main","default_branch":"main","status":{"clean":true,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":0,"untracke